{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","梅瑞特"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵巧的射手，当远离敌人时能发挥更大的作用。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啧，是场硬仗啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Whew! What a tough fight."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我好像长高了一点儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I think I grew taller!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","我就在——这儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","I'm right over... here!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","总会有这一天的……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","This day... was always... going to come."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","今天的箭格外有准头啊"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","My shots are perfect today!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","哦？有猎物吗？交给我吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯，嗯，怎么，找我有事？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","呃，没猎物呀，呸，再等会儿吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","没了人吧？哼。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哇哇，我从来没有用过这么精致的东西！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢你的礼物！如果需要我帮忙，就尽管说吧！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","游林飞矢"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","合格的猎手会用好每一支箭矢。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","绿林疾风"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","她是绿林间的猎手，为猎物拉弓，也为正义振弦。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","参与活动“英雄之影”可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/provenance/localization/RequireDes/languages/en",{"source":"luae_map","source_file":"luae_translation_map_en.csv","pair_order":"26214"}],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","爷爷奶奶应该会喜欢这里"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","最近毛皮好像涨价了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我要带点糖果回去"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这些小灯真漂亮啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","该给家人准备礼物了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，有好吃的！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","等下要去大采购！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特的箭术偷师于一些薄暮丛林边境的绿裔，并且凭借着自己的天赋进行了一些合理的改动。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特在买东西时偶尔会露出看到猎物般势在必得的残酷眼神。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特箭囊上的毛皮是她亲手所获的猎物，她每打到个大家伙，就一定会留点战利品在身上。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特异常擅长讲价，或许是对她来说，商品的底价和猎物的要害是同一回事——而只要是要害，就瞒不过猎人敏锐的目光。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特很少做所谓的弓术训练，因为每根箭都不能浪费。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","一片随手摘下的叶子，在梅瑞特手中能成为一件简易但有用的乐器——叶哨笛。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“她从盗匪、野兽和魔偶手中保护我们，也把我们从大坑、悬崖和水潭里拉上来。跟她相比，我们才更像无用的人。”——某位冬青学会的学者。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","贩卖猎物时，梅瑞特基本上只收现金，但偶尔也接受以物易物——比如一些弟弟妹妹们没吃过的特殊糖果。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特的猎物一直很受山货商人的欢迎，因为她的箭无比准确，猎物宝贵的皮毛常常保持完好。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特上一次落泪是在十四岁生日的深夜，因为她发觉，梦中父母的长相已经开始变得模糊了。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","毛皮……矿石……零件……编织物……唔唔唔唔……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","爷爷奶奶应该会喜欢这里"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415062.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我要带点糖果回去"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415063.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这些小灯真漂亮啊！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415367.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","该给家人准备礼物了！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415368.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","哇哦，有好吃的！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415537.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","等下要去大采购！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415538.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","我啊，一直都想有些弟弟妹妹……"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","啊，糟糕，箭囊上的毛皮好像被打湿了……"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"]]}